  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen you are looking at your own Profile in Landscape mode there are quite a few issues:\n\n1. Your entire screen will be taken up by your VRChat+ Profile Banner\n\n2. You can't scroll down\n\nBoth of these are mostly noticeable on Android Tablets.\n\n# Expected Behaviour\n\n1. The Banner should be limited in size so that it doesn't take over your entire screen\n\n2. You should be able to scroll down",
